{"steam_appid":3094480,"steam_name":"Bad Cheese","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3094480/1577261107/6b170949f008fbecc4a9d6a5ad44c51749786347/1756480509/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773334238","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190780/0b095a12c636f918f4c49fd758530bfc8a3bc960/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773334238","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/2f7c8b8ed823a7d68eb0a2d449cf83b1b10ae2cc/ss_2f7c8b8ed823a7d68eb0a2d449cf83b1b10ae2cc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778532201","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/44e96564e620b2083658c45671d1989035e93343/ss_44e96564e620b2083658c45671d1989035e93343.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778532201","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/09450e53da9d63b574b19e93d3227df9195bb721/ss_09450e53da9d63b574b19e93d3227df9195bb721.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778532201","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/c44ad6d2ad39eced6397eebce130316e6aa89882/ss_c44ad6d2ad39eced6397eebce130316e6aa89882.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778532201","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/8d1b4a51ce58df07bc60be84a5c27723ca353fbb/ss_8d1b4a51ce58df07bc60be84a5c27723ca353fbb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778532201"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/22dd1290fb9fd9f32808fb63f6183616.avif?t=1778532201\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the tiny paws of a mouse spending the weekend at home with a dysfunctional Dad while Mom's away. Be on your best behavior and KEEP DADDY HAPPY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/a55d8994e569cf89d610a5f68e467100.webp?t=1778532201\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/4985e539107367de84706158fd7ce9fc.poster.avif?t=1778532201\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/4985e539107367de84706158fd7ce9fc.webm?t=1778532201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/4985e539107367de84706158fd7ce9fc.mp4?t=1778532201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You all live together. You, Dad, Mom, Brother, and the rest of the demons. Try not to cause problems so you don't have to be punished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/97080775d356f69f9b9f19fbb5cae62e.webp?t=1778532201\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/6e8781af5e7612511c3c75924cf7bae6.poster.avif?t=1778532201\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/6e8781af5e7612511c3c75924cf7bae6.webm?t=1778532201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/6e8781af5e7612511c3c75924cf7bae6.mp4?t=1778532201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrub, sweep, clean, make fries, kill spiders, bring Daddy his pills—essentially, be a good kid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/80a7c4a1c8e42d7355ca167d338bab8f.webp?t=1778532201\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/e50c5762db860bd791fd140e5e0ab8b6.poster.avif?t=1778532201\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/e50c5762db860bd791fd140e5e0ab8b6.webm?t=1778532201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/e50c5762db860bd791fd140e5e0ab8b6.mp4?t=1778532201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house and look for treats and action figures scattered around. This might be the only fun part about living here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/8f6b46b761ce787e2eede29bec84502d.webp?t=1778532201\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/9b9da384624d45610651468f15c76566.poster.avif?t=1778532201\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/9b9da384624d45610651468f15c76566.webm?t=1778532201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/9b9da384624d45610651468f15c76566.mp4?t=1778532201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit various parts of the house, face difficult situations, and experience the gruesome reality of a child-mouse trying to maintain a sense of normalcy in an abnormal household.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/75a24c7748a9ee95b9fbcf8b47f49d31.webp?t=1778532201\" width=616 height=55 /></span> </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"developers":["Simon Lukasik"],"publishers":["Feardemic"],"release_date":"1 Sep, 2025"}